        {
          "id": 2016901940,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Here is a screenshot of the specification, indicating that the units for AMBR should in fact be `kbps`: ![image](/uploads/82f8d29342d9feedcf2d088dbc275813/image.png).\n\nAdditionally, here are the Bearer QOS Bitrate definitions, also all in `kbps`: ![image](/uploads/c1ecbfbff9fe61aa32f9ecb2e00a05ae/image.png)\n\nHere is a screenshot of how the dissector looks with the addition of units: ![image](/uploads/46dd84907dd951a41a9340c802ee4e3c/image.png)",
